# The define sets of water/main.frag with a Slang twin (task 0072, water family): what the GLSL compiles with. The
# water's pipeline asks for BUMP_MAP only (apps/openmw/mwrender/water.cpp), which the stage imports; the rest are the
# "#define" lines of shadow.settings (lib/view/shadow.glsl), set by the settings: CLOUD_SHADOW (cloud shadows, with hdr
# and atmosphere), CLOUD_SHADOW_DEBUG (only with CLOUD_SHADOW), VOLUME_CLOUD_SHADOW (volumetric clouds and their
# shadows) and DEBUG_SHADOW (the shadows' debug hud). Every combination is listed: 3 x 2 x 2.
BUMP_MAP
BUMP_MAP DEBUG_SHADOW
BUMP_MAP VOLUME_CLOUD_SHADOW
BUMP_MAP DEBUG_SHADOW VOLUME_CLOUD_SHADOW
BUMP_MAP CLOUD_SHADOW
BUMP_MAP CLOUD_SHADOW DEBUG_SHADOW
BUMP_MAP CLOUD_SHADOW VOLUME_CLOUD_SHADOW
BUMP_MAP CLOUD_SHADOW DEBUG_SHADOW VOLUME_CLOUD_SHADOW
BUMP_MAP CLOUD_SHADOW CLOUD_SHADOW_DEBUG
BUMP_MAP CLOUD_SHADOW CLOUD_SHADOW_DEBUG DEBUG_SHADOW
BUMP_MAP CLOUD_SHADOW CLOUD_SHADOW_DEBUG VOLUME_CLOUD_SHADOW
BUMP_MAP CLOUD_SHADOW CLOUD_SHADOW_DEBUG DEBUG_SHADOW VOLUME_CLOUD_SHADOW
